---
import type {Product} from '../data/catalogue';
import Picture from './Picture.astro';
import ModelComparison from './ModelComparison.astro';
const {product:p}=Astro.props as {product:Product};
const tabs=['Overview','Features & uses','Specifications','Build & towing','Options & included','Warranty & FAQ'];
const features=[{title:'Body & load area',image:p.images[0],text:'Consider the load dimensions, access and how equipment will be secured. The confirmed quote specifies the body and usable load area.'},{title:'Loading & access',image:p.images[p.images.length-1],text:'Discuss ramp access, side openings and your loading method. Check equipment dimensions against the final trailer specification.'},{title:'Running gear',image:p.images[0],text:'Axles, brakes, suspension, coupling and tyres must be confirmed for the intended load and towing vehicle.'}];
---
<section class="product-information section" id="product-information"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT INFORMATION</p><h2>Get to know the {p.name.toLowerCase()}.</h2></div><p class="section-description">Explore the layout and the details to confirm in your quote.</p></div><div class="spec-highlights">{[['Layout',p.pictured[0]],['Capacity','Confirm with quote'],['Dimensions','Confirm with quote'],['Availability','Confirm with quote']].map(([name,value])=><div><strong>{value}</strong><span>{name}</span></div>)}</div><div class="product-tabs" data-tabs><div class="product-tab-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Product details" aria-orientation="vertical">{tabs.map((name,i)=><button role="tab" id={`detail-tab-${i}`} aria-selected={i===0} aria-controls={`detail-panel-${i}`} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}>{name}<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>)}</div><div class="product-tab-content"><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-0" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-0"><h3>Product overview</h3><p>{p.description}</p><p>Use this illustrated design as the starting point for a configuration that fits your requirements. Share the load, towing vehicle, loading method and preferred access when requesting a quote.</p><a class="text-link" href="#configuration">Review your requirements →</a></article><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-1" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-1" hidden><h3>Features & uses</h3><ul class="check-list">{p.pictured.map(feature=><li>{feature}</li>)}</ul><p>These features describe the illustration. Ask the team to confirm the arrangement and equipment available for your order.</p></article><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-2" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-2" hidden><h3>Specifications</h3><table class="specs"><caption>Confirmed specification</caption><tbody>{['Deck dimensions','ATM / tare / payload','Braking system','Finish & materials','Included equipment','Availability & lead time'].map(label=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>Confirmed with your quote</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></article><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-3" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-3" hidden><h3>Build & towing</h3><p>Confirm construction, axle and braking details against your towing vehicle and intended load. The design illustration does not establish a certified capacity.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Trailer and towing vehicle ratings</li><li>Coupling and electrical compatibility</li><li>Load dimensions and restraint points</li><li>Loading access and operating conditions</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/guides/">Read trailer planning guides →</a></article><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-4" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-4" hidden><h3>Options & included equipment</h3><p>Record your storage, loading, spare-wheel and equipment requirements in the configuration form. Approved priced options appear there when available.</p><p>Tools, vehicles and accessories in illustrations are included only when identified in your written quote.</p><a class="text-link" href="#configuration">Configure this trailer →</a></article><article role="tabpanel" id="detail-panel-5" aria-labelledby="detail-tab-5" hidden><h3>Warranty & common questions</h3><details><summary>What is included with the trailer?</summary><p>Your written quote lists the approved trailer specification and included equipment.</p></details><details><summary>Can I request another configuration?</summary><p>Include the changes you need in your enquiry. Suitability and availability need to be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Where do I collect my trailer?</summary><p>The collection address and timing are confirmed with your order. Please confirm before travelling.</p></details><details><summary>Which warranty applies?</summary><p>Request the warranty document for the quoted model and configuration before purchase.</p></details><a class="text-link" href="/trailer-warranty/">Warranty information →</a></article></div></div><div class="product-help"><div><h3>Make the details clear before you order.</h3><p>Work through your load, options and collection requirements.</p></div><a class="button" href="#configuration">Review configuration →</a></div></section>
<ModelComparison product={p}/><section class="section build-details"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK</p><h2>Explore the design.</h2></div><p class="section-description">Select a topic to work through the specification you need.</p></div><div data-tabs>{features.map((feature,i)=><div role="tabpanel" id={`build-panel-${i}`} aria-labelledby={`build-tab-${i}`} hidden={i!==0} class="build-panel"><Picture name={feature.image} alt={`${p.name} design illustration`}/><div><p class="eyebrow">0{i+1} / DESIGN PLANNING</p><h3>{feature.title}</h3><p>{feature.text}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/quote/?product=${p.id}`}>Discuss this trailer →</a></div></div>)}<div class="build-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Trailer design details">{features.map((feature,i)=><button role="tab" id={`build-tab-${i}`} aria-selected={i===0} aria-controls={`build-panel-${i}`} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}><small>0{i+1}</small>{feature.title}<span>→</span></button>)}</div></div></section>
